{"seq":1,"slug":"state-management-patterns","title":"状态管理模式对比：Riverpod、Bloc、Provider 与 Signals","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/flutter-development/architecture/state-management-patterns","wordCount":723,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"状态管理模式对比-riverpod-bloc-provider-与-signals\">状态管理模式对比：Riverpod、Bloc、Provider 与 Signals</h1><p>Flutter 官方不内置状态管理方案，社区发展出了多种成熟解决方案。选择合适的状态管理方案直接影响代码可维护性、可测试性和团队协作效率。本文系统对比主流方案，给出选型建议。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>状态（State）</strong></td>\n<td>随时间可变、影响 UI 渲染的数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>单向数据流</strong></td>\n<td>状态变化只能从「单一方向」触发 UI 更新，便于追踪和调试</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Notifier</strong></td>\n<td>Riverpod 中管理状态逻辑的类，类似 ViewModel</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Provider（概念）</strong></td>\n<td>向 Widget 树提供值的机制（注意：也是同名的包）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Bloc</strong></td>\n<td>业务逻辑组件，输入 Event，输出 State 流</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Cubit</strong></td>\n<td>Bloc 的简化版，直接暴露方法而非 Event 枚举</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Signal</strong></td>\n<td>响应式原语，细粒度订阅，修改时精准通知订阅者</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>InheritedWidget</strong></td>\n<td>Flutter 框架内置的状态向下传递机制，所有状态管理库的底层基础</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"各方案横向对比\">各方案横向对比</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>Provider（遗留）</th>\n<th>Riverpod 2.x</th>\n<th>Bloc/Cubit</th>\n<th>Signals</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>学习曲线</strong></td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中高</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>类型安全</strong></td>\n<td>中（需 context）</td>\n<td>高（无 context）</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>代码生成</strong></td>\n<td>可选</td>\n<td>可选（<code>@riverpod</code>）</td>\n<td>可选（freezed）</td>\n<td>无需</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>可测试性</strong></td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>高（ProviderContainer）</td>\n<td>高（blocTest）</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>适用规模</strong></td>\n<td>中小型</td>\n<td>全规模</td>\n<td>中大型</td>\n<td>中小型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>维护状态</strong></td>\n<td>活跃（兼容维护）</td>\n<td>主流推荐</td>\n<td>活跃</td>\n<td>新兴</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>官方推荐</strong></td>\n<td>是（旧）</td>\n<td>是（新）</td>\n<td>非官方但主流</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"riverpod-2-x-现代-flutter-状态管理标准\">Riverpod 2.x：现代 Flutter 状态管理标准</h2><p>Riverpod 是 Provider 的完全重写版本，解决了 Provider 的核心痛点（依赖 BuildContext、难以组合、运行时类型错误）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  subgraph RiverpodLayer[&quot;Riverpod 层&quot;]&#10;    P1[userProvider\\nFutureProvider] --&gt; P2[userProfileProvider\\nProvider]&#10;    P2 --&gt; P3[greetingProvider\\nProvider]&#10;  end&#10;&#10;  subgraph WidgetLayer[&quot;Widget 层&quot;]&#10;    W1[UserProfilePage\\nconsumerWidget] --&gt; W2[GreetingText\\nconsumerWidget]&#10;  end&#10;&#10;  P1 -.-&gt;|watch| W1&#10;  P3 -.-&gt;|watch| W2\">graph TD\n  subgraph RiverpodLayer[\"Riverpod 层\"]\n    P1[userProvider\\nFutureProvider] --&gt; P2[userProfileProvider\\nProvider]\n    P2 --&gt; P3[greetingProvider\\nProvider]\n  end\n\n  subgraph WidgetLayer[\"Widget 层\"]\n    W1[UserProfilePage\\nconsumerWidget] --&gt; W2[GreetingText\\nconsumerWidget]\n  end\n\n  P1 -.-&gt;|watch| W1\n  P3 -.-&gt;|watch| W2</pre><h3 id=\"基础用法-代码生成风格-推荐\">基础用法（代码生成风格，推荐）</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"dart\" data-code=\"// providers/user_provider.dart&#10;import &#39;package:riverpod_annotation/riverpod_annotation.dart&#39;;&#10;part &#39;user_provider.g.dart&#39;;&#10;&#10;// 同步 Provider&#10;@riverpod&#10;String greeting(GreetingRef ref) {&#10;  final user = ref.watch(currentUserProvider);&#10;  return &#39;Hello, ${user.name}!&#39;;&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 异步 Provider（FutureProvider）&#10;@riverpod&#10;Future&lt;User&gt; currentUser(CurrentUserRef ref) async {&#10;  final repo = ref.watch(userRepositoryProvider);&#10;  return repo.getCurrentUser();&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 可变状态（StateNotifier 的替代）&#10;@riverpod&#10;class CartNotifier extends _$CartNotifier {&#10;  @override&#10;  List&lt;CartItem&gt; build() =&gt; [];&#10;&#10;  void addItem(CartItem item) {&#10;    state = [...state, item];&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  void removeItem(String id) {&#10;    state = state.where((item) =&gt; item.id != id).toList();&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  double get total =&gt; state.fold(0, (sum, item) =&gt; sum + item.price);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// providers/user_provider.dart</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import 'package:riverpod_annotation/riverpod_annotation.dart';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>part 'user_provider.g.dart';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 同步 Provider</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@riverpod</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>String greeting(GreetingRef ref) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  final user = ref.watch(currentUserProvider);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return 'Hello, ${user.name}!';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 异步 Provider（FutureProvider）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@riverpod</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Future&#x3C;User> currentUser(CurrentUserRef ref) async {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  final repo = ref.watch(userRepositoryProvider);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return repo.getCurrentUser();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 可变状态（StateNotifier 的替代）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@riverpod</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class CartNotifier extends _$CartNotifier {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  @override</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  List&#x3C;CartItem> build() => [];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  void addItem(CartItem item) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    state = [...state, item];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  void removeItem(String id) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    state = state.where((item) => item.id != id).toList();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  double get total => state.fold(0, (sum, item) => sum + item.price);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"widget-中使用\">Widget 中使用</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"dart\" data-code=\"class CartPage extends ConsumerWidget {&#10;  const CartPage({super.key});&#10;&#10;  @override&#10;  Widget build(BuildContext context, WidgetRef ref) {&#10;    // watch：状态变化时重建&#10;    final cartItems = ref.watch(cartNotifierProvider);&#10;    // read：只读取一次，不订阅&#10;    final notifier = ref.read(cartNotifierProvider.notifier);&#10;&#10;    return ListView.builder(&#10;      itemCount: cartItems.length,&#10;      itemBuilder: (context, index) {&#10;        final item = cartItems[index];&#10;        return ListTile(&#10;          title: Text(item.name),&#10;          trailing: IconButton(&#10;            icon: const Icon(Icons.delete),&#10;            onPressed: () =&gt; notifier.removeItem(item.id),&#10;          ),&#10;        );&#10;      },&#10;    );&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>class CartPage extends ConsumerWidget {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const CartPage({super.key});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  @override</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Widget build(BuildContext context, WidgetRef ref) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // watch：状态变化时重建</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    final cartItems = ref.watch(cartNotifierProvider);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // read：只读取一次，不订阅</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    final notifier = ref.read(cartNotifierProvider.notifier);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return ListView.builder(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      itemCount: cartItems.length,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      itemBuilder: (context, index) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        final item = cartItems[index];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return ListTile(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          title: Text(item.name),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          trailing: IconButton(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            icon: const Icon(Icons.delete),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            onPressed: () => notifier.removeItem(item.id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          ),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"异步状态处理\">异步状态处理</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"dart\" data-code=\"class UserProfilePage extends ConsumerWidget {&#10;  @override&#10;  Widget build(BuildContext context, WidgetRef ref) {&#10;    final userAsync = ref.watch(currentUserProvider);&#10;&#10;    // AsyncValue 的模式匹配（Dart 3.x）&#10;    return switch (userAsync) {&#10;      AsyncData(:final value) =&gt; UserProfileView(user: value),&#10;      AsyncError(:final error) =&gt; ErrorView(message: error.toString()),&#10;      AsyncLoading() =&gt; const CircularProgressIndicator(),&#10;    };&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>class UserProfilePage extends ConsumerWidget {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  @override</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Widget build(BuildContext context, WidgetRef ref) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    final userAsync = ref.watch(currentUserProvider);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // AsyncValue 的模式匹配（Dart 3.x）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return switch (userAsync) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      AsyncData(:final value) => UserProfileView(user: value),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      AsyncError(:final error) => ErrorView(message: error.toString()),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      AsyncLoading() => const CircularProgressIndicator(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"bloc-cubit-事件驱动的企业级状态管理\">Bloc/Cubit：事件驱动的企业级状态管理</h2><p>Bloc（Business Logic Component）通过严格的 Event → State 单向流提供可预测的状态变更，适合需要严格可审计状态机的大型团队项目。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;  participant Widget as Widget&#10;  participant Bloc as CounterBloc&#10;  participant State as CounterState&#10;&#10;  Widget-&gt;&gt;Bloc: add(IncrementEvent)&#10;  Bloc-&gt;&gt;Bloc: mapEventToState&#10;  Bloc-&gt;&gt;State: emit(CounterState(count: n+1))&#10;  State--&gt;&gt;Widget: StreamBuilder rebuild\">sequenceDiagram\n  participant Widget as Widget\n  participant Bloc as CounterBloc\n  participant State as CounterState\n\n  Widget-&gt;&gt;Bloc: add(IncrementEvent)\n  Bloc-&gt;&gt;Bloc: mapEventToState\n  Bloc-&gt;&gt;State: emit(CounterState(count: n+1))\n  State--&gt;&gt;Widget: StreamBuilder rebuild</pre><h3 id=\"cubit-简化版-bloc\">Cubit（简化版 Bloc）</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"dart\" data-code=\"// cubit/counter_cubit.dart&#10;class CounterState extends Equatable {&#10;  final int count;&#10;  const CounterState(this.count);&#10;&#10;  @override&#10;  List&lt;Object&gt; get props =&gt; [count];&#10;}&#10;&#10;class CounterCubit extends Cubit&lt;CounterState&gt; {&#10;  CounterCubit() : super(const CounterState(0));&#10;&#10;  void increment() =&gt; emit(CounterState(state.count + 1));&#10;  void decrement() =&gt; emit(CounterState(state.count - 1));&#10;  void reset() =&gt; emit(const CounterState(0));&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// cubit/counter_cubit.dart</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class CounterState extends Equatable {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  final int count;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const CounterState(this.count);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  @override</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  List&#x3C;Object> get props => [count];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class CounterCubit extends Cubit&#x3C;CounterState> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  CounterCubit() : super(const CounterState(0));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  void increment() => emit(CounterState(state.count + 1));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  void decrement() => emit(CounterState(state.count - 1));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  void reset() => emit(const CounterState(0));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"dart\" data-code=\"// Widget 使用&#10;BlocProvider(&#10;  create: (_) =&gt; CounterCubit(),&#10;  child: BlocBuilder&lt;CounterCubit, CounterState&gt;(&#10;    builder: (context, state) {&#10;      return Text(&#39;Count: ${state.count}&#39;);&#10;    },&#10;  ),&#10;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// Widget 使用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>BlocProvider(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  create: (_) => CounterCubit(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  child: BlocBuilder&#x3C;CounterCubit, CounterState>(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    builder: (context, state) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      return Text('Count: ${state.count}');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  ),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"signals-细粒度响应式状态\">Signals：细粒度响应式状态</h2><p>Signals（<code>package:signals</code>）是近年兴起的响应式状态管理方案，借鉴 Preact Signals 的细粒度订阅思想：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"dart\" data-code=\"// 创建 Signal&#10;final counter = signal(0);&#10;final doubleCounter = computed(() =&gt; counter.value * 2);&#10;&#10;// Widget 中订阅&#10;class CounterWidget extends StatelessWidget {&#10;  @override&#10;  Widget build(BuildContext context) {&#10;    return Watch((context) {&#10;      // 只有 counter 或 doubleCounter 变化时才重建&#10;      return Text(&#39;${counter.value} × 2 = ${doubleCounter.value}&#39;);&#10;    });&#10;  }&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 更新&#10;counter.value++;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 创建 Signal</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>final counter = signal(0);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>final doubleCounter = computed(() => counter.value * 2);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// Widget 中订阅</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class CounterWidget extends StatelessWidget {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  @override</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Widget build(BuildContext context) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return Watch((context) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      // 只有 counter 或 doubleCounter 变化时才重建</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      return Text('${counter.value} × 2 = ${doubleCounter.value}');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 更新</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>counter.value++;</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"选型决策树\">选型决策树</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[新项目或重构?] --&gt; B{团队规模}&#10;  B --&gt;|1-3人| C{复杂度}&#10;  B --&gt;|4+人| D[Riverpod 2.x\\n+ 代码生成]&#10;  C --&gt;|简单 CRUD| E[Riverpod 2.x\\n无代码生成]&#10;  C --&gt;|复杂业务流| D&#10;  D --&gt; F{需要严格\\n状态机审计?}&#10;  F --&gt;|是| G[Bloc/Cubit]&#10;  F --&gt;|否| D\">graph TD\n  A[新项目或重构?] --&gt; B{团队规模}\n  B --&gt;|1-3人| C{复杂度}\n  B --&gt;|4+人| D[Riverpod 2.x\\n+ 代码生成]\n  C --&gt;|简单 CRUD| E[Riverpod 2.x\\n无代码生成]\n  C --&gt;|复杂业务流| D\n  D --&gt; F{需要严格\\n状态机审计?}\n  F --&gt;|是| G[Bloc/Cubit]\n  F --&gt;|否| D</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>推荐方案</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>新项目，任意规模</td>\n<td>Riverpod 2.x</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>银行/金融/严格审计场景</td>\n<td>Bloc/Cubit</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>遗留 Provider 项目</td>\n<td>逐步迁移到 Riverpod</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>轻量原型 / 小组件</td>\n<td><code>ValueNotifier</code> + <code>ValueListenableBuilder</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>Flutter 状态管理没有唯一正解，但在 2025-2026 的生态下，<strong>Riverpod 2.x 是最推荐的通用选择</strong>：它解决了 Provider 的核心痛点（类型安全、无 BuildContext 依赖、可组合），同时支持从简单 <code>Provider</code> 到复杂异步 <code>FutureProvider</code> 的全场景覆盖。<strong>Bloc/Cubit</strong> 适合需要严格可追溯状态机的大型企业项目。遗留的 <code>Provider</code> 包仍可用，但新项目不应选用。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"相关文档\">相关文档</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"clean-architecture-flutter\">Clean Architecture 实践</a> — 状态管理与分层架构的集成</li>\n<li><a href=\"navigation-routing\">导航与路由 2.0</a> — 路由状态与应用状态的协作</li>\n<li><a href=\"../production/testing-strategies\">测试策略</a> — 如何测试 Riverpod Provider 和 Bloc</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"状态管理模式对比：Riverpod、Bloc、Provider 与 Signals","id":"状态管理模式对比-riverpod-bloc-provider-与-signals"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"各方案横向对比","id":"各方案横向对比"},{"level":2,"text":"Riverpod 2.x：现代 Flutter 状态管理标准","id":"riverpod-2-x-现代-flutter-状态管理标准"},{"level":3,"text":"基础用法（代码生成风格，推荐）","id":"基础用法-代码生成风格-推荐"},{"level":3,"text":"Widget 中使用","id":"widget-中使用"},{"level":3,"text":"异步状态处理","id":"异步状态处理"},{"level":2,"text":"Bloc/Cubit：事件驱动的企业级状态管理","id":"bloc-cubit-事件驱动的企业级状态管理"},{"level":3,"text":"Cubit（简化版 Bloc）","id":"cubit-简化版-bloc"},{"level":2,"text":"Signals：细粒度响应式状态","id":"signals-细粒度响应式状态"},{"level":2,"text":"选型决策树","id":"选型决策树"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"相关文档","id":"相关文档"}],"prev":{"title":"Platform Channel 通信：Flutter 与原生平台互操作","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/flutter-development/foundations/platform-channels"},"next":{"title":"Clean Architecture 在 Flutter 中的实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/flutter-development/architecture/clean-architecture-flutter"}}